  "changes": [
    "Fresh batched stock reconciliation, distant-observer broad phase, personal ammunition read batching and lazy physical cargo reservation remove repeated world scans without cross-frame caches.",
    "Build elapsed-time presentation refreshes markers/earned work; committed events retain full refresh. Private logistics status refreshes only the visible Supplies panel.",
    "Clear construction access segments use the same current authoritative bounds/obstacle test before falling back to the visibility graph.",
    "Event-woken finite rear logistics passes request actual next-batch hauling and real dispatch fulfilment; no materials, people, fuel or trucks are granted.",
    "Physical HQ-to-front freight prepares bounded routes, claims exact fresh source portions, and preserves real loading, travel, unload, return, interruption and local Engineer issue.",
    "Actual passenger approaches are prepared in chunks and admitted only against unchanged current people/hull/world facts; synchronous explicit callers retain their original validation.",
    "Live squad decisions retain FIFO due work and execute one fresh squad transaction per pump; foot route preparation is private and checks current order/person/load/terrain before motion starts.",
    "While planning/decisions are pending, their work and complete simulation transactions use separate returned frames. Actual elapsed simulation debt is retained; no time is discarded.",
    "A real-time Godot Timer collects diagnostic windows; console output drains with a cooperative per-frame allowance and flushes at exit. Counts/unique caller groups retain their original monotonic seconds."
  ],
  "design_justification": [
    {
      "principle": "Single authoritative owner and conservation",
      "application": "Existing ledger, hauling, Dispatch and ForwardSupply services own every physical mutation. New controllers submit their real commands and subtract existing commitments."
    },
    {
      "principle": "Fresh admission after private preparation",
      "application": "Time-sliced geometry writes no physical state. Admission rechecks exact source portions, ownership, handlers, fuel, load, route world, intent and people before an atomic transition."
    },
    {
      "principle": "Bounded work with liveness",
      "application": "Expensive preparation and due AI decisions are distributed; simulation time and decision backlog are measured so smooth frames cannot conceal dropped work."
    },
    {
      "principle": "Measure specific bottlenecks and instrumentation overhead",
      "application": "Inclusive scopes identified actual route/decision spikes and console costs. Whole-frame/action thresholds were not raised and earlier failures remain under logs."
    }
  ],
